🚽 TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR: RUN
🚽
🚽 An endless runner in Brainrot, rendered through rayrot. Tung Tung Tung
🚽 Sahur runs east to wake the village for the pre-dawn meal; Brr Brr
🚽 Patapim keeps getting in the way.
🚽
🚽     jump to survive, bonk to score
🚽
🚽 Build and run:
🚽     make play
🚽
🚽 What lives here is the frame loop's SHAPE: the state machine, the entity
🚽 pools, and the order the eleven steps run in. Each step's actual work is
🚽 in sim.brainrot, taking the entity or player it acts on plus the world.
🚽
🚽 The pool loops stay here because they have to. A struct field cannot be
🚽 an array of structs, and there is no pointer arithmetic on struct
🚽 pointers, so a helper cannot walk a pool -- only act on one
🚽 already-resolved `&pool[i]`. See DESIGN.md 14.1 and 15.2.

#cooked <raylib>
#cooked "tune.brainrot"
#cooked "math.brainrot"
#cooked "collide.brainrot"
#cooked "curve.brainrot"
#cooked "sim.brainrot"
#cooked "platform.brainrot"
#cooked "draw.brainrot"

skibidi main {
    plat_open();

    🚽 Art and audio are both optional. A -1 handle means "not available",
    🚽 and every consumer of one already handles that: the player falls back
    🚽 to the M0 rectangle, and the music seam simply runs silent. Cloning
    🚽 this repo without assets, or running it over SSH, still gives a game.
    rizz tex_run   = draw_load("assets/tung_run.png");
    rizz tex_jump  = draw_load("assets/tung_jump.png");
    rizz tex_swing = draw_load("assets/tung_swing.png");
    rizz tex_pat   = draw_load("assets/patapim_run.png");
    rizz tex_vaca  = draw_load("assets/vaca.png");
    rizz tex_crate = draw_load("assets/crate.png");
    rizz tex_post  = draw_load("assets/post.png");
    rizz bg_far    = draw_load("assets/bg_far.png");
    rizz bg_mid    = draw_load("assets/bg_mid.png");
    rizz bg_near   = draw_load("assets/bg_near.png");
    rizz bg_fore   = draw_load("assets/bg_fore.png");
    rizz tex_shark = draw_load("assets/tralalero.png");
    rizz tex_croc  = draw_load("assets/bombardiro.png");
    rizz tex_dindin = draw_load("assets/dindin.png");
    rizz tex_combi  = draw_load("assets/combinacion.png");
    rizz tex_bomb  = draw_load("assets/bomb.png");
    rizz tex_blast = draw_load("assets/blast.png");
    🚽 Both tracks are LOADED but not played. The main track starts only when
    🚽 a run begins (ENTER) and stops on game over; the boss track detonates at
    🚽 the end of the Combinasion reveal (12.6.1) and loops under the fight.
    rizz music     = plat_music_load("assets/music/tung-tung.ogg");
    rizz music_boss = plat_music_load("assets/music/finalboss.ogg");
    rizz sfx_tung   = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/tung.ogg");
    rizz sfx_jump   = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/jump.ogg");
    rizz sfx_damage = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/damage.ogg");
    rizz sfx_bruh   = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/bruh.ogg");
    rizz sfx_pop    = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/pop.ogg");
    rizz sfx_ugh    = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/ugh.ogg");
    rizz sfx_bark   = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/bark.ogg");
    rizz sfx_fart   = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/fart.ogg");
    rizz sfx_nonono = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/nonono.ogg");
    rizz sfx_susp   = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/suspense.ogg");
    rizz sfx_wow    = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/wow.ogg");

    🚽 The opening sting, played once here and never again. It belongs to
    🚽 the title card, and the title is only ever seen at startup -- a
    🚽 restart goes straight back to the run.
    rizz sfx_open = plat_sfx_load("assets/sfx/opening.ogg");
    plat_sfx_play(sfx_open);

    🚽 Array sizes must be literals, so this is the one place the pool
    🚽 bounds are written twice. Fail loudly rather than quietly walking
    🚽 off the end of a pool if someone edits tune.brainrot alone.
    rizz MAX_OBS = 16;
    rizz MAX_EN  = 16;
    rizz MAX_BMB = 32;
    bet(MAX_OBS == t_max_obstacles(), "MAX_OBS must match t_max_obstacles()");
    bet(MAX_EN  == t_max_enemies(),   "MAX_EN must match t_max_enemies()");
    bet(MAX_BMB == t_max_bombs(),     "MAX_BMB must match t_max_bombs()");

    rizz state    = t_state_title();
    chad title_t  = 0.0;
    rizz frame    = 0;
    rizz run_seed = 20260827;

    🚽 The 1280x720 framebuffer the whole scene draws into, then blitted
    🚽 scaled-to-fit to the window (any size / fullscreen). -1 if unavailable.
    rizz fb        = plat_framebuffer_make();
    🚽 Pause-menu selection: 0 RESUME, 1 RESTART, 2 QUIT.
    rizz pause_sel = 0;

    gang World wd;
    gang Player pl;
    gang Ent obstacles[16];
    gang Ent enemies[16];
    gang Boss bo;
    gang Bomb bombs[32];

    🚽 One reset path, used by both the first run and every restart.
    cap do_reset = W;
    cap running  = W;

    🚽 Rising edge of the bat's live window, so a Combinasion parry (12.6.4)
    🚽 rings its CLANG once per swing rather than every frame the bat is out.
    cap was_swinging = L;

    🚽 Which way Tung faces (+1 right, -1 left). Only ever -1 in the Combinasion
    🚽 fight, where he walks both ways; the runner always faces +1. Persists
    🚽 between frames so an idle Tung keeps facing the way he last walked.
    rizz tung_face = 1;

    🚽 The La Grande Combinasion reveal (12.6.1): a timed cinematic between U
    🚽 Din Din's death and the fight going live. reveal_t counts up from 0; the
    🚽 flags fire its one-shots (music cut, first cue, the detonation) once.
    chad reveal_t   = 0.0;
    cap  in_reveal  = L;
    cap  rv_cut     = L;
    cap  rv_boom    = L;
    chad namecard_t = 0.0;
    🚽 True while his fight is actually live, so its end reads as a WIN rather
    🚽 than a death (the run continued past U Din Din, and the player won it).
    cap  combi_live_prev = L;

    goon (running) {
        edgy (do_reset) {
            player_reset(&pl);
            world_reset(&wd);

            🚽 Each run advances the seed, so runs differ -- but the whole
            🚽 sequence is reproducible from the initial constant, and the
            🚽 seed that produced a run is shown when it ends.
            run_seed = rng_next(run_seed);
            wd.seed  = rng_next(run_seed);
            wd.next_kind = pick_kind(wd.seed, 1, L);

            pool_clear(&obstacles[0], MAX_OBS);
            pool_clear(&enemies[0], MAX_EN);
            bombs_clear(&bombs[0], MAX_BMB);
            boss_clear(&bo);

            🚽 Silence the boss track and clear the reveal. The main track
            🚽 plays only for a RUN, from the top -- do_reset also fires once at
            🚽 the title (state still title), where it must stay silent.
            plat_music_stop(music_boss);
            edgy (state == t_state_run()) { plat_music_play(music); }
            amogus { plat_music_stop(music); }
            reveal_t   = 0.0;
            in_reveal  = L;
            rv_cut     = L;
            rv_boom    = L;
            namecard_t = 0.0;
            combi_live_prev = L;
            tung_face  = 1;

            do_reset = L;
        }

        plat_music_tick(music);
        🚽 Both streams pump every frame; the boss one is silent until played.
        plat_music_tick(music_boss);

        🚽 --- 1. frame time -------------------------------------------
        🚽 The clamp is not optional. rl_get_frame_time after a window
        🚽 drag can return a large dt, and at 900 px/s an unclamped spike
        🚽 tunnels every entity straight through the player.
        wd.dt = plat_dt(frame);
        edgy (wd.dt > t_dt_max()) { wd.dt = t_dt_max(); }

        🚽 --- window controls: fullscreen, and ESC (pause / resume / quit) ---
        🚽 Handled BEFORE in_run below, so a pause takes hold this same frame --
        🚽 the sim is already gated on state==run, so pausing freezes it.
        cap fs = plat_fullscreen_pressed(frame);
        edgy (fs) { plat_toggle_fullscreen(); }

        cap esc = plat_pause_pressed(frame);
        edgy (esc) {
            edgy (state == t_state_run()) {
                state     = t_state_pause();
                pause_sel = 0;
            }
            amogus {
                🚽 In the pause menu ESC resumes; on the title/over/win screens
                🚽 it still quits (safe -- you are not mid-run).
                edgy (state == t_state_pause()) { state = t_state_run(); }
                amogus { running = L; }
            }
        }

        edgy (state == t_state_pause()) {
            cap up = plat_menu_up_pressed(frame);
            edgy (up) {
                pause_sel = pause_sel - 1;
                edgy (pause_sel < 0) { pause_sel = 2; }
            }
            cap dn = plat_menu_down_pressed(frame);
            edgy (dn) {
                pause_sel = pause_sel + 1;
                edgy (pause_sel > 2) { pause_sel = 0; }
            }
            cap pick = plat_enter_pressed(frame);
            edgy (pick) {
                edgy (pause_sel == 0) { state = t_state_run(); }
                edgy (pause_sel == 1) { state = t_state_run(); do_reset = W; }
                edgy (pause_sel == 2) { running = L; }
            }
        }

        cap in_run = L;
        edgy (state == t_state_run()) { in_run = W; }

        🚽 The simulation runs only when the run is LIVE -- during the
        🚽 Combinasion reveal (12.6.1) the scene freezes and the player is a
        🚽 spectator, so world/input/physics/fight all pause on `live`, not
        🚽 `in_run`. `live == in_run` in every other situation.
        cap live = L;
        edgy (in_run) { live = !in_reveal; }

        🚽 The Combinasion set piece -- the reveal AND the fight -- is a still,
        🚽 drained arena, not the runner. The world stops scrolling and the sky
        🚽 stays black for as long as he is up: no running, the scene holds dead
        🚽 while Tung moves. (12.6.1 / 12.6.2.)
        cap combi_scene = L;
        edgy (boss_active(&bo)) { combi_scene = bo.kind == t_boss_combinasion(); }

        🚽 --- 2. speed curve ------------------------------------------
        edgy (live && !combi_scene) { world_advance(&wd); }
        rizz lvl   = speed_to_lvl(wd.speed);
        rizz score = world_score(&wd);

        🚽 --- 3. input ------------------------------------------------
        🚽 Whether Tung walked horizontally this frame, so the draw picks the
        🚽 walk cycle vs. the standing idle in the frozen arena.
        cap moving_now = L;
        edgy (live) {
            cap jump = plat_jump_down(frame);
            edgy (jump) {
                cap launched = player_jump(&pl);
                edgy (launched) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_jump); }
            }
            cap bat = plat_bat_pressed(frame);
            edgy (bat) {
                🚽 tung.ogg is the swing sound now, on every real swing (not the
                🚽 ones refused mid-cooldown). Bonks have their own sounds.
                cap fresh_swing = pl.atk_t <= 0.0;
                player_swing(&pl);
                edgy (fresh_swing) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_tung); }
            }

            🚽 Horizontal movement is live ONLY in the Combinasion fight
            🚽 (12.6.2) -- the one boss that unpins Tung. Everywhere else his
            🚽 x stays at t_player_x(), so nothing else changes.
            cap combi_fight = boss_active(&bo);
            edgy (combi_fight) { combi_fight = bo.kind == t_boss_combinasion(); }
            edgy (combi_fight) {
                cap goleft = plat_left_down(frame);
                edgy (goleft) {
                    player_move_x(&pl, 0 - 1, &wd);
                    moving_now = W;
                    tung_face  = 0 - 1;
                }
                cap goright = plat_right_down(frame);
                edgy (goright) {
                    player_move_x(&pl, 1, &wd);
                    moving_now = W;
                    tung_face  = 1;
                }
            }
        }

        🚽 --- 4. player physics ---------------------------------------
        edgy (live) { player_physics(&pl, &wd); }

        🚽 --- 5. timers -----------------------------------------------
        edgy (live) { player_tick_timers(&pl, &wd); }
        cap swinging = player_swinging(&pl);
        🚽 The bat only reaches forward (+x), so a swing always faces right --
        🚽 otherwise Tung would bonk behind where the sprite points.
        edgy (combi_scene && swinging) { tung_face = 1; }

        🚽 --- 6a. boss ------------------------------------------------
        🚽 Before spawning, because a boss that has just started must own
        🚽 the spawner on the very frame it appears -- otherwise the curve
        🚽 gets one more entity in while the fight is already on screen.
        cap boss_up = L;
        edgy (in_run) {
            🚽 Mirror Tung's live column so combi_move() can teleport relative
            🚽 to him without a Player pointer through boss_tick(). Equals
            🚽 t_player_x() in every mode but the Combinasion fight.
            wd.tung_x = pl.x;
            cap fighting = boss_active(&bo);
            edgy (!fighting && !in_reveal) {
                rizz due = boss_due(&wd, lvl);
                edgy (due != t_boss_none()) {
                    boss_start(&bo, &wd, due);
                    🚽 Clear the field: a boss is a duel, not chaos on top of
                    🚽 chaos. Tralalero's own body is the threat now; the croc
                    🚽 then spawns its bombs into an empty screen.
                    pool_clear(&obstacles[0], MAX_OBS);
                    pool_clear(&enemies[0], MAX_EN);
                    bombs_clear(&bombs[0], MAX_BMB);
                    🚽 The final boss does not just appear -- U Din Din's death
                    🚽 runs the reveal first (12.6.1). The fight is frozen until
                    🚽 it finishes; every other boss starts fighting at once.
                    edgy (due == t_boss_combinasion()) {
                        in_reveal = W;
                        reveal_t  = 0.0;
                        rv_cut = L;
                        rv_boom = L;
                        yapping("the run did not end. lvl %d, score %d.",
                                lvl, score);
                    }
                    amogus {
                        plat_sfx_play(sfx_bark);
                        yapping("boss %d incoming at lvl %d (score %d)",
                                due, lvl, score);
                    }
                }
            }
            🚽 Advance the fight only when live -- frozen during the reveal.
            edgy (live) { boss_tick(&bo, &wd); }
            boss_up = boss_owns_spawner(&bo);
        }

        🚽 --- 6c. the reveal ------------------------------------------
        🚽 A frozen, timed cinematic (12.6.1). The scene holds; the normal
        🚽 track plays on so the run seems to continue, then cuts mid-stream;
        🚽 the sky drains and the HUD flickers (both in the draw section off
        🚽 reveal_t); after a silent gap he walks in from the right and the
        🚽 prog track detonates as the fight goes live.
        edgy (in_reveal) {
            reveal_t = reveal_t + wd.dt;

            edgy (!rv_cut && reveal_t >= t_reveal_cut()) {
                🚽 The mid-stream cut -- not at a loop boundary. Then, out of the
                🚽 silence, the suspense creeps in: the developer is coming.
                plat_music_stop(music);
                plat_sfx_play(sfx_susp);
                rv_cut = W;
            }
            edgy (reveal_t >= t_reveal_walk()) {
                🚽 Walk in from the right edge to his mark. Draw a standing
                🚽 pose (recover = frame 0), facing left toward Tung.
                chad wspan = t_reveal_done() - t_reveal_walk();
                chad wprog = clampf((reveal_t - t_reveal_walk()) / wspan,
                                    0.0, 1.0);
                bo.x     = lerpf(t_screen_w(), t_reveal_walk_x(), wprog);
                bo.y     = t_ground_y() - t_combi_h();
                bo.state = t_cs_recover();
                bo.dir   = 0 - 1;
            }
            edgy (!rv_boom && reveal_t >= t_reveal_boom()) {
                🚽 Full silhouette in: the name card, and the track detonates.
                plat_music_play(music_boss);
                namecard_t = 1.6;
                rv_boom = W;
            }
            edgy (reveal_t >= t_reveal_boom()) {
                🚽 Fight LIVE: hand him back to his own machine, fresh.
                in_reveal  = L;
                bo.state   = t_cs_out();
                bo.phase_t = 0.0;
                bo.script_i = 0;
            }
        }
        edgy (namecard_t > 0.0) { namecard_t = namecard_t - wd.dt; }

        🚽 --- 6b. spawning ---------------------------------------------
        🚽 Paused for the whole fight: the boss owns the pattern. Its own
        🚽 cadence is denser than the curve ever gets, and that density is
        🚽 the fight.
        🚽 boss_may_spawn() shuts the croc's bomb bay while a release would
        🚽 be unfair -- too low for a full fall, or too close to Tung's column
        🚽 to be dodged -- and it wraps the CLOCK as well as the drop.
        🚽 Skipping only the drop would leave a bomb due the whole time he is
        🚽 diving, and he would release it the frame he got back into
        🚽 position: the same bad drop, moved. Frozen, he finishes the
        🚽 interval he was part-way through instead.
        🚽 Croc only. Tralalero no longer spawns a barrage -- his own charging
        🚽 body is the threat, and shark_charge_move() owns bo.spawn_t as its
        🚽 charge timer, so main must not touch it during his fight.
        cap may_spawn = boss_may_spawn(&bo, &wd);
        edgy (in_run && boss_up && may_spawn && bo.kind == t_boss_bombardiro()) {
            bo.spawn_t = bo.spawn_t - wd.dt;
            edgy (bo.spawn_t <= 0.0) {
                rizz slot = bombs_free_slot(&bombs[0], MAX_BMB);
                edgy (slot >= 0) { bomb_spawn(&bombs[slot], &bo); }
                🚽 Bombs are not a jump obstacle, so they have their own
                🚽 cadence rather than borrowing the ground one.
                bo.spawn_t = t_bomb_interval();
            }
        }

        edgy (in_run && !boss_up) {
            wd.spawn_t = wd.spawn_t - wd.dt;
            edgy (wd.spawn_t <= 0.0) {
                🚽 Past the Bombardiro fight the ground obstacles are gone for
                🚽 good -- only flying Vacas (DESIGN.md 9.6). This also clears any
                🚽 crate/post that was still pending from before the fight.
                edgy (wd.did_bombardiro) { wd.next_kind = t_kind_vaca(); }

                cap is_enemy = L;
                edgy (wd.next_kind == t_kind_patapim()) { is_enemy = W; }
                edgy (wd.next_kind == t_kind_vaca()) { is_enemy = W; }

                edgy (is_enemy) {
                    rizz slot = pool_free_slot(&enemies[0], MAX_EN);
                    edgy (slot >= 0) {
                        ent_spawn(&enemies[slot], wd.next_kind);
                        🚽 Flying Vacas take one of three fixed heights; its band
                        🚽 comes from a fresh draw (DESIGN.md 9.6).
                        edgy (wd.next_kind == t_kind_vaca()) {
                            wd.seed = rng_next(wd.seed);
                            enemies[slot].y = vaca_band_y(wd.seed);
                        }
                    }
                }
                amogus {
                    rizz slot = pool_free_slot(&obstacles[0], MAX_OBS);
                    edgy (slot >= 0) { ent_spawn(&obstacles[slot], wd.next_kind); }
                }

                🚽 Decide the next kind now, so the fairness clamp knows
                🚽 both ends of the gap it is about to size.
                wd.prev_kind = wd.next_kind;
                wd.seed      = rng_next(wd.seed);
                🚽 After the Bombardiro fight the charging enemy is Vaca Saturno
                🚽 instead of Patapim (DESIGN.md 9.6).
                wd.next_kind = pick_kind(wd.seed, lvl, wd.did_bombardiro);

                wd.seed    = rng_next(wd.seed);
                chad gap   = spawn_gap(wd.speed) + rng_signed(wd.seed) * t_gap_jitter();
                wd.spawn_t = fair_clamp(gap, wd.prev_kind, wd.next_kind);
            }
        }

        🚽 --- 7. obstacles: scroll, then body collision ----------------
        edgy (live) {
            pool_scroll(&obstacles[0], MAX_OBS, &wd, 0.0);
            cap obs_hurt = pool_body_pass(&obstacles[0], MAX_OBS, &pl, &wd);
            edgy (obs_hurt) {
                boss_note_hit(&bo);
                🚽 The killing blow gets the death sting instead of the
                🚽 grunt -- see the sfx_bruh play in step 9.
                edgy (pl.hearts > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_ugh); }
            }
        }

        🚽 --- 8. enemies: scroll, bat pass, then body pass -------------
        🚽 Bat before body, so a frame-perfect swing always beats the
        🚽 collision.
        edgy (live) {
            pool_scroll(&enemies[0], MAX_EN, &wd, t_enemy_close());
            edgy (swinging) {
                rizz bonks = pool_bat_pass(&enemies[0], MAX_EN, &pl, &wd);
                edgy (bonks > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_pop); }
            }
            cap en_hurt = pool_body_pass(&enemies[0], MAX_EN, &pl, &wd);
            edgy (en_hurt) {
                boss_note_hit(&bo);
                edgy (pl.hearts > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_ugh); }
            }
        }

        🚽 --- 8b. bombs: fall, burn, then hurt -------------------------
        edgy (live) {
            🚽 A bomb hitting the ground sounds its impact, separately from the
            🚽 blast then catching the player (which grunts below).
            rizz bmb_landed = bombs_step(&bombs[0], MAX_BMB, &wd);
            edgy (bmb_landed > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_damage); }
            cap bmb_hurt = bombs_body_pass(&bombs[0], MAX_BMB, &pl, &wd);
            edgy (bmb_hurt) {
                boss_note_hit(&bo);
                edgy (pl.hearts > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_ugh); }
            }
        }

        🚽 --- 8c. the boss itself: bat pass, then body pass -------------
        🚽 Bat before body, same as enemies, so a frame-perfect swing at an
        🚽 opening always beats the collision. Frozen during the reveal (live).
        edgy (live) {
            edgy (boss_active(&bo)) {
                cap can_bonk = boss_vulnerable(&bo);
                🚽 Combinasion's bat reach is off Tung's LIVE column (he moves);
                🚽 every other boss is fought from the pinned t_player_x().
                cap in_reach = boss_in_bat(&bo, &pl);
                edgy (bo.kind == t_boss_combinasion()) {
                    in_reach = combi_in_bat(&bo, &pl);
                }
                cap swing_start = swinging;
                edgy (was_swinging) { swing_start = L; }
                edgy (swinging && can_bonk) {
                    edgy (in_reach) {
                        boss_take_bonk(&bo, &wd);
                        🚽 The final boss's hits land as damage.ogg; the other
                        🚽 three take a fart.ogg.
                        edgy (bo.kind == t_boss_combinasion()) {
                            plat_sfx_play(sfx_damage);
                        }
                        amogus { plat_sfx_play(sfx_fart); }
                    }
                }
                🚽 Parry (Combinasion only): a swing that connects while he is
                🚽 NOT recovering is blocked -- CLANG, no damage. It only says
                🚽 "you cannot unga-bunga this boss"; the cost is the wasted
                🚽 swing, nothing more (12.6.4). Once per swing, on the edge.
                edgy (bo.kind == t_boss_combinasion()) {
                    edgy (swing_start && !can_bonk && in_reach) {
                        plat_sfx_play(sfx_bruh);
                    }
                }
                🚽 The croc still has no body-contact pass -- it never
                🚽 positions itself into Tung (boss_hits_body invariant); it
                🚽 hurts through its bombs. Tralalero, though, IS the threat:
                🚽 shark_contact_hit() fires only in a dodgeable state (jump
                🚽 the low charge, duck the high cross), so contact damage
                🚽 here is always something the player could have avoided.
                edgy (bo.kind == t_boss_tralalero() && player_vulnerable(&pl)) {
                    edgy (shark_contact_hit(&bo, &pl)) {
                        player_take_hit(&pl, &wd);
                        boss_note_hit(&bo);
                        edgy (pl.hearts > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_ugh); }
                    }
                }
                🚽 U Din Din's charging body: a low sweep. Grounded contact
                🚽 hurts (jump it, or bonk him); airborne is always safe.
                edgy (bo.kind == t_boss_dimdim() && player_vulnerable(&pl)) {
                    edgy (dindin_contact_hit(&bo, &pl)) {
                        player_take_hit(&pl, &wd);
                        boss_note_hit(&bo);
                        edgy (pl.hearts > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_ugh); }
                    }
                }
                🚽 La Grande Combinasion's swing: a low forward sweep. Grounded
                🚽 contact in the arc hurts; a jump is always safe (12.6).
                edgy (bo.kind == t_boss_combinasion() && player_vulnerable(&pl)) {
                    edgy (combi_contact_hit(&bo, &pl)) {
                        player_take_hit(&pl, &wd);
                        boss_note_hit(&bo);
                        edgy (pl.hearts > 0) { plat_sfx_play(sfx_ugh); }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        was_swinging = swinging;

        🚽 Beating the developer is a WIN, not a death (12.6.11). combi_live is
        🚽 true only while his fight actually runs; when it ends with the player
        🚽 still alive -- he was cleared by the third bonk -- the run is won.
        cap combi_live = L;
        edgy (boss_active(&bo)) {
            edgy (bo.kind == t_boss_combinasion()) { combi_live = !in_reveal; }
        }
        edgy (combi_live_prev && !combi_live && pl.hearts > 0) {
            edgy (!boss_active(&bo)) {
                state = t_state_win();
                🚽 Beat the game: the boss track stops and wow.ogg celebrates.
                plat_music_stop(music_boss);
                plat_sfx_play(sfx_wow);
                yapping("SAHUR SAVED -- the developer is beaten. score %d",
                        score);
            }
        }
        combi_live_prev = combi_live;

        🚽 --- 9. state transitions -------------------------------------
        edgy (state == t_state_title()) {
            title_t = title_t + wd.dt;
            edgy (title_t > 2.2) {
                edgy (plat_enter_pressed(frame)) {
                    state    = t_state_run();
                    do_reset = W;
                }
            }
        }

        🚽 `in_run` was sampled at the top of this frame, so this block sees
        🚽 the death on the frame it happens and never again -- the next
        🚽 frame reads t_state_over(). That is what makes one `bruh` per
        🚽 run rather than one per frame spent on the game-over screen.
        edgy (in_run) {
            edgy (pl.hearts <= 0) {
                state = t_state_over();
                🚽 Game over: both tracks stop -- the main one, or the boss one
                🚽 if you died to the final boss -- and the death sting plays:
                🚽 bruh.ogg, then nonono.ogg right on top of it.
                plat_music_stop(music);
                plat_music_stop(music_boss);
                plat_sfx_play(sfx_bruh);
                plat_sfx_play(sfx_nonono);
                yapping("run over -- score %d, seed %d, frames %d",
                        score, run_seed, frame);
            }
        }

        edgy (state == t_state_over()) {
            cap again = plat_enter_pressed(frame);
            edgy (again) {
                state    = t_state_run();
                do_reset = W;
            }
        }

        edgy (state == t_state_win()) {
            cap again = plat_enter_pressed(frame);
            edgy (again) {
                state    = t_state_run();
                do_reset = W;
            }
        }

        plat_trace(frame, score, lvl, pl.hearts, wd.combo, wd.speed, pl.y,
                   wd.dist);

        🚽 --- 10. draw --------------------------------------------------
        🚽 The reveal drains the sky to grey (12.6.1) -- a ramp on reveal_t --
        🚽 and flickers the HUD once the drain begins, then holds it off.
        chad drain = 0.0;
        cap  hud_on = W;
        edgy (combi_scene) {
            edgy (in_reveal) {
                🚽 During the reveal: normal sky until the drain stage, then a
                🚽 ramp to black, and the HUD flickers while it drains.
                edgy (reveal_t >= t_reveal_dark()) { drain = 1.0; }
                amogus edgy (reveal_t >= t_reveal_drain()) {
                    chad dspan = t_reveal_dark() - t_reveal_drain();
                    drain = clampf((reveal_t - t_reveal_drain()) / dspan,
                                   0.0, 1.0);
                }
                edgy (reveal_t >= t_reveal_drain()) {
                    rizz tick = reveal_t * 8.0;
                    edgy (tick % 2 == 0) { hud_on = L; }
                }
            }
            amogus {
                🚽 The live fight: the sky stays fully drained.
                drain = 1.0;
            }
        }

        draw_begin(fb);
        draw_sky(lvl, drain);
        draw_background(bg_far, bg_mid, bg_near, bg_fore, wd.dist);
        draw_ground();

        flex (rizz i = 0; i < MAX_OBS; i = i + 1) {
            edgy (obstacles[i].alive) {
                draw_ent(obstacles[i].x, obstacles[i].y,
                         obstacles[i].w, obstacles[i].h, obstacles[i].kind,
                         tex_pat, tex_crate, tex_post, tex_vaca, 0);
            }
        }
        flex (rizz i = 0; i < MAX_EN; i = i + 1) {
            edgy (enemies[i].alive) {
                🚽 Patapim and Vaca share the enemy pool but animate off their
                🚽 own frame counters.
                rizz efr = patapim_frame(&enemies[i]);
                edgy (enemies[i].kind == t_kind_vaca()) {
                    efr = vaca_frame(&enemies[i]);
                }
                draw_ent(enemies[i].x, enemies[i].y,
                         enemies[i].w, enemies[i].h, enemies[i].kind,
                         tex_pat, tex_crate, tex_post, tex_vaca, efr);
            }
        }

        🚽 Swing wins over jump wins over run: while the bat is out that is
        🚽 what the player needs to see, airborne or not, because that is
        🚽 when the hitbox is live.
        rizz tex   = tex_run;
        rizz frame_i = run_frame(&wd);
        🚽 In the frozen Combinasion arena the world does not scroll, so the run
        🚽 cycle comes from Tung's own horizontal walking, and a neutral pose
        🚽 stands him still when he is not moving. Swing/jump still override.
        edgy (combi_scene) {
            edgy (moving_now) { frame_i = walk_frame(&pl); }
            amogus { frame_i = t_walk_idle(); }
        }
        edgy (pl.atk_t > 0.0) {
            tex     = tex_swing;
            frame_i = swing_frame(&pl);
        }
        amogus {
            edgy (!pl.grounded) {
                tex     = tex_jump;
                frame_i = jump_frame(&pl);
            }
        }

        🚽 Drawn at pl.x, which is t_player_x() everywhere except the
        🚽 Combinasion fight (the one place Tung moves horizontally, 12.6.2).
        edgy (player_visible(&pl)) {
            draw_player(pl.x, pl.y, tex, frame_i, tung_face);
        }
        edgy (swinging) { draw_bat(pl.x, pl.y, tex_swing); }

        🚽 Markers first, so a bomb never hides its own warning.
        flex (rizz i = 0; i < MAX_BMB; i = i + 1) {
            edgy (bombs[i].alive) {
                cap falling = bombs[i].fuse <= 0.0;
                edgy (falling) {
                    draw_bomb_mark(bomb_landing_x(&bombs[i], &wd),
                                   bombs[i].y + bomb_h(&bombs[i]),
                                   bombs[i].fall_t);
                }
            }
        }
        flex (rizz i = 0; i < MAX_BMB; i = i + 1) {
            edgy (bombs[i].alive) {
                cap burning = bombs[i].fuse > 0.0;
                draw_bomb(bombs[i].x, bombs[i].y,
                          bomb_w(&bombs[i]), bomb_h(&bombs[i]), burning,
                          tex_bomb, tex_blast);
            }
        }

        cap boss_shown = boss_active(&bo);
        edgy (boss_shown) {
            draw_boss(bo.x, bo.y, bo.kind, bo.phase, bo.phase_t, bo.dir,
                      bo.state, bo.dest_x, bo.script_i,
                      tex_shark, tex_croc, tex_dindin, tex_combi);
        }

        🚽 HUD flickers during the reveal, then holds off entirely (hud_on).
        edgy (hud_on) {
            draw_hearts(pl.hearts);
            draw_speedbar(lvl);
            draw_hud(score, lvl);
            edgy (boss_shown && !in_reveal) {
                cap boss_ready = boss_vulnerable(&bo);
                🚽 Combinasion's opening is the recovery itself -- he never
                🚽 parks, so gate the prompt on vulnerability alone (like U Din
                🚽 Din, whose charge is the window). Parking bosses gate on
                🚽 arrival too.
                edgy (boss_ready && bo.kind != t_boss_combinasion()) {
                    boss_ready = boss_in_position(&bo, &wd);
                }
                draw_boss_bar(bo.kind, bo.bonks, boss_ready);
            }
        }

        🚽 The reveal's name card, at the detonation and briefly after.
        edgy (namecard_t > 0.0) { draw_namecard(); }

        edgy (state == t_state_title()) { draw_title(title_t); }
        edgy (state == t_state_over())  { draw_gameover(score, run_seed); }
        edgy (state == t_state_win())   { draw_win(score, run_seed); }
        🚽 The pause menu draws over the frozen scene, inside the framebuffer.
        edgy (state == t_state_pause())  { draw_pause(pause_sel); }

        draw_end(fb);

        🚽 --- 11. quit --------------------------------------------------
        edgy (plat_should_close(frame)) { running = L; }

        frame = frame + 1;
    }

    draw_unload(tex_run);
    draw_unload(tex_jump);
    draw_unload(tex_swing);
    draw_unload(tex_pat);
    draw_unload(tex_vaca);
    draw_unload(tex_crate);
    draw_unload(tex_post);
    draw_unload(bg_far);
    draw_unload(bg_mid);
    draw_unload(bg_near);
    draw_unload(bg_fore);
    draw_unload(tex_shark);
    draw_unload(tex_croc);
    draw_unload(tex_dindin);
    draw_unload(tex_combi);
    draw_unload(tex_bomb);
    draw_unload(tex_blast);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_open);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_tung);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_jump);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_damage);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_bruh);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_pop);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_ugh);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_bark);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_fart);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_nonono);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_susp);
    plat_sfx_close(sfx_wow);
    plat_framebuffer_free(fb);
    plat_music_unload(music_boss);
    plat_music_close(music);
    plat_close();
    bussin 0;
}
